<title>BELGIUM: Mobutu has left Kinshasa - Belgian foreign minister.</title>
<headline>Mobutu has left Kinshasa - Belgian foreign minister.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Mobutu Sese Seko has left Zaire, Belgian Foreign Minister Eric Derycke said in a statement on Friday, calling for a peaceful transition of power.</p>
</text>
